          "Where a suitable service opening is proposed, agree who can reach and operate it, its required size and how it will be closed after work. A small opening that admits a hand may not be adequate for replacing a component. The building's maintenance team should review the plan before installation, reducing the chance that another contractor later cuts an uncontrolled gap through the net.",
