          "Deep shafts and high openings need a professional access assessment. Residents should provide photographs only from suitable existing positions and should not lean into the void to measure it. The installation proposal should identify access arrangements, site coordination and any work that must be completed first. Where structural condition or the intended protective function is uncertain, obtain the relevant specialist assessment before selecting the net system.",
