          "Agree an inspection owner and a way to report damage or accumulated debris. Netting across a horizontal opening needs attention if material collects on it; it should not become a substitute for keeping waste out of the duct. Later pipe repairs, AC replacements and façade work may alter the perimeter. Keep installation records accessible to maintenance contractors and review closures after their work is complete.",
