        "Ceiling pulley dryers, wall-mounted racks and movable stands solve different space problems. A ceiling model can free floor area when suitably installed, while a wall arrangement may suit a location with appropriate wall support and limited ceiling access. The chosen product's mounting and load instructions should govern the installation. A generic promise about carrying a large weight is not a substitute for the actual model specification.",
