          "Discuss your typical laundry instead of selecting only by rod count. Sarees, bedsheets, school uniforms and towels use the available space differently. More closely packed rods do not guarantee that a full load will dry comfortably. Choose a layout that leaves useful separation between garments and a clear route for everyday balcony tasks. The final arrangement should also leave lights and service equipment reachable.",
