          "For wall-mounted systems, the wall condition and bracket arrangement need the same attention. Loose plaster or tiles do not establish the strength of the material behind them. In a rented home, confirm permission for the specific fixing locations before drilling. If the available structure is unsuitable, compare an alternative layout or a freestanding product instead of forcing the chosen model into the original position.",
