          "Use the manufacturer's stated limits for the actual model, including any per-rod and whole-system requirements. Wet laundry, uneven loading and bulky bedding need consideration within those instructions. Do not test the hanger by hanging from it or use it for storage, swings or other loads. The handover should show normal operation and explain when an unusual resistance, tilted rod or loose bracket calls for service.",
