          "Keep rods and operating parts clean according to the product instructions. Check for damaged cords, rough rod surfaces, unusual movement or loosening mounts and stop using an affected system until it has been assessed. Ask which replacement parts are available and how service can be arranged. Position controls and loose cords with the household in mind, including children, and keep the surrounding walkway clear while loading.",
